            <ArticleTitle>[Acute abdomen caused by retroperitoneal hemangiopericytoma (indications of a clinical case)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>533-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors describe a case of acute abdomen due to retroperitoneal hemorrhage in a patient suffering from perirenal hemangiopericytoma. They emphasize the rareness of such clinical picture and the difficulties involved in the radical surgical extirpation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
